cWJVZY2kmH4O94gAWtzIl1LNkJugSgwnZ8iblgkZ2J4NasRlh3HnAmPkmhGicP7sAfJrqfhYIibpjBQZECP9Yqo3mQ/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 本次夏令营住宿费、外出资源调查交通费由项目经费统一承担，全程不收取学生报名费、培训费及其他费用。</span></p><p><span>2.参加队员须签订安全责任承诺书，并为参加本次夏令营的师生统一购买实习责任险和人身意外伤害险。</span></p><p><span>3. 本次夏令营部分物资由横峰瑞贝福（江西）饮料有限公司公益赞助支持，所有物资仅供本次夏令营教学研学使用，不作任何商业推广与功效宣传。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM463P2vhMME1swUJ2qJIriawgzOKchnBALu0Oib1eaw9uud8zDQB8XIe9rSPFFYdibMQtvUMVyU3yeJm0HvWO92Vvxz7offoVqFoWjZ2WnBabP0w/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM7sXF9MXEFDQ4mIlNoiaZqTgVqic7JAnyMAM4oL0GN5tC6NPxOQpRUcTqTtRPh6TsDhzCUkBPadiaLTZPbDPAThXX0p2xe2ovO1TBORREianupoGQ/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 所有报名材料须真实、准确、有效。凡存在弄虚作假者，一经查实，立即取消入营及结业资格，并通报所在学校。</span></p><p><span>2. 营员须严格遵守学校规章制度与夏令营管理要求，服从带队老师统一安排，不得擅自离队、私自外出。遇突发情况须第一时间向工作人员报备。</span></p><p><span>3. 野外采药实践期间注意出行安全，做好防晒、防虫、防滑防护，文明科考、规范采样。</span></p><p><span>4.因队员自身原因（包括但不限于自身有慢性疾病、隐形疾病、身体承受力不足等原因）所导致的身体不适及引发相关疾病、症状的（包括但不限于中暑、昏厥等）， 若最终被保险公司认定不属于理赔范围，则由此产生的一切法律责任及后果（包括但不限于医疗救治费用、误工损失、伤残赔偿或补偿、死亡赔偿金等）均由本人自行承担。</span></p><p><span>5. 营员须按时参加各项学习、实践等环节，不得无故缺席、缺勤。</span></p><p><span>6.建议携带物品：笔记本、笔、水杯、常用药品、防晒用品等。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM4dY8R4bd5PcqXBzLClRmD0J0992ENgmZcrz7Xe2umvv7cjnFLtFpYMDARVicqbB3qjmao175Lzqb7aXv24Qhia9StPb3xbCnDEaoWpE5dsOA8Q/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人与联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM7Ns73nNwIBB09ItmoTMqaPibmdHXybFicVSUR2LSu4wRBxOjEdjsgJD86jmPeahzhuWkm6baFfNad32FMTK9YpsuWA1LFQn4SiaF7oUkQ9yl68w/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>林贵兵老师联系电话：</span><strong><span>15879053621</span></strong><span>（微信同号）</span></p><p><span>封勇老师联系电话：</span><strong><span>13677007329</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></se